# 流星创作台 MCP 请求示例
# 将占位符替换为自己的值；不要分享含真实 Key 或签名地址的文件。
# 第 1–6 项只查询。第 7 项申请临时上传，第 8 项写入自己的参考素材。
# 第 9–10 项会提交付费生成；不要批量执行全部请求，也不要自动重试创建请求。

@base = https://api.meteor21c.fun
@apiKey = YOUR_METEOR_API_KEY
@taskId = TASK_ID_FROM_CREATE
@materialId = MATERIAL_ID_FROM_UPLOAD
@uploadUrl = https://api.meteor21c.fun/mcp/assets/UPLOAD_ID?exp=REPLACE&op=upload&sig=REPLACE
@resultUrl = https://api.meteor21c.fun/mcp/assets/RESULT_ID?exp=REPLACE&op=read&sig=REPLACE

### 1. 初始化
POST {{base}}/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "initialize",
  "params": {
    "protocolVersion": "2025-06-18",
    "capabilities": {},
    "clientInfo": {"name": "my-meteor-client", "version": "1.0.0"}
  }
}

### 2. 获取工具和参数
POST {{base}}/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2,"method":"tools/list","params":{}}

### 3. 获取当前 Key 的模型
GET {{base}}/v1/models
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### 4. 获取视频目录和计费场景
GET {{base}}/v1/videos/pricing?catalog=true&model=doubao-seedance-2.0
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### 5. 获取匹配参数的价格与预扣（参数需与实际生成一致）
GET {{base}}/v1/videos/pricing?model=doubao-seedance-2.0&resolution=720p&duration=5&aspect_ratio=16%3A9&audio=true&input_video=false
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### 6. 获取本人已结算费用历史
GET {{base}}/v1/videos/pricing?model=doubao-seedance-2.0&history=true
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### 7. 申请参考图片上传地址；把 size_bytes 改为文件的准确字节数
POST {{base}}/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 7,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "create_material_upload",
    "arguments": {
      "file_name": "reference.png",
      "content_type": "image/png",
      "size_bytes": 123456
    }
  }
}

### 8. 上传原始图片；先更新 uploadUrl，并确保本机确实存在 reference.png
PUT {{uploadUrl}}
Content-Type: image/png

< ./reference.png

### 9. 付费：生成一张图片；先确认 model 出现在自己的模型列表中且支持 Images 接口
POST {{base}}/mcp/image
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 9,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "create_image",
    "arguments": {
      "model": "gpt-image-2",
      "prompt": "一张简洁的春日咖啡店插画，暖色调，无文字",
      "n": 1,
      "size": "1024x1024"
    }
  }
}

### 10. 付费：创建一个视频；创建后保存 task_id，不重复提交
POST {{base}}/mcp/video
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 10,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "create_video",
    "arguments": {
      "model": "doubao-seedance-2.0-mini",
      "prompt": "海边清晨，镜头缓慢向前移动，海浪轻拍岸边，画面稳定自然",
      "duration": 5,
      "resolution": "720p",
      "aspect_ratio": "16:9",
      "audio": false
    }
  }
}

### 11. 查询视频；将 taskId 改为创建时返回的真实 ID
POST {{base}}/mcp/video
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 11,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "get_video",
    "arguments": {"task_id": "{{taskId}}"}
  }
}

### 12. 下载签名结果；先更新 resultUrl，无需重复生成
GET {{resultUrl}}
Range: bytes=0-1023
